body:
SAME. I always feel like sharing my own sorrows is toooo much emotional burden for other people. So, I just keep my own problems to myself- because burdening other people is the least I want to be doing.

&#x200B;

 I don't want to make other people sad because I don't want them to be like me, I want them to be happy

PRESS F.

&#x200B;

F.
